  "Not on a deck-list form: free-hand list on blank paper, name only (no side box, event or date). Side LS by contents.",
  "No line numbers; n = order read. Counts (\"x2\", \"x10\") expanded to one entry per copy. Total comes to 65 lines - the systems listed (Tatooine, Ralltiir, Kessel, Endor, Coruscant, Chandrila at top; Chandrila, Kashyyyk, Ralltiir, Kiffex, Aquaris at the end) probably include Hidden Base system cards outside the 60; transcribed as written.",
